From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: j773g: Add GPU and PMP handoff

Include the common M4 GPU description and provide the PMP alias used by
m1n1 to supply its configuration. Enable the PMP transport and retain
the startup report votes used by Gravity Linux on the Mac mini.

Leave the GPU, its reserved-memory placeholders and PMP itself disabled
until the bootloader has supplied their firmware state. Do not import
a fixed physical ramoops reservation or laptop thermal limits. The
existing SoC-level always-on AGX vote protects PMP when no GPU is bound.
SIO is deliberately not voted before PMP starts.

Based on Gravity Linux commits c1d54471b5ea (GPU), 238d1053955f (PMP),
262812702fc5 (activity votes) and 3d28fd11e212 (SIO startup).
Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
[Firn: reuse shared nodes; retain bootloader-gated firmware enablement.]
Link: https://github.com/GravityLinux/linux/commit/c1d54471b5ea8049eacf032b4bfb36eba65192b4
Link: https://github.com/GravityLinux/linux/commit/238d1053955ff7d5d00e0300ac53a8f855dd0ad4
Link: https://github.com/GravityLinux/linux/commit/3d28fd11e212caaa34901985daa61cdf75bc27b7

Assisted-by: LLM
